<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Kimberly Clark paying 0.75 peso dividend.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Kimberly Clark paying 0.75 peso dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberly Clark de Mexico said Tuesday it will pay a cash dividend of 0.75 pesos for each share in circulation.</p>
<p>This will be the fourth payment in a three-peso dividend approved by stockholders in a March 20 meeting.</p>
<p>According to a report sent to the Mexican stock market, Kimberly Clark said it will pay the dividend beginning Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9562</p>
